          TWO REAL BUGS FOUND BY THE HARNESS: (1) use-trace
          oof-stop: collinear wall pieces flanking a switch (E1M1
          lines 329/331 around exit 330) sort ahead of it and kill
          the trace - vanilla only works by blockmap-order luck;
          added a segment-span gate (crossing must land on the
          segment, 1u slack).  (2) first gate attempt used exact
          bbox equality, but exact-west aims 0x7FFFFFFF (one BAM
          unit off axis, vanilla-exact), so the crossing missed by
          subunits - the 1u slack covers it.  Validated headless
          (throwaway harness, outside repo): W1 96 -> -40 exactly
          (highest surrounding -48 + 8) with W1 clear; WR plat dips
